- Action items: optimize CAC channels with best payback, reduce churn via retention programs, increase ARPU via packaging/upsell, and model hiring/funding against 12–18 month growth plans.
- Ask for a decision: whether leadership wants growth-first (higher CAC, longer payback) or efficiency-first (lower CAC, shorter payback) to set budget.

Next steps I can do for you
- If you give me S&M spend and new customers (quarter or year), gross margin, churn, and customer counts (or ARPU), I’ll compute CAC, LTV, payback, LTV:CAC and produce a 3-scenario sensitivity table for the slide deck.  
