- Payback period (months) = CAC / (ARPA_month * Gross_Margin)
- LTV / CAC ratio = LTV / CAC
Benchmarks: aim for LTV/CAC ≥ 3 and payback ≤ 12 months (depends on stage).

Useful derived numbers from what you gave
- Monthly revenue (last quarter): 670K / 3 = $223,333 / month
- Annual run-rate (simple): 223,333 * 12 ≈ $2.68M ARR

