- LTV (simple, gross-margin adjusted) = ARPU_monthly * Gross_margin% / Churn_rate_monthly
  - Equivalent: LTV = (ARPU_monthly * Gross_margin) * (1 / monthly_churn) — interprets average lifetime = 1/churn
- CAC payback (months) = CAC / (ARPU_monthly * Gross_margin)
- LTV : CAC ratio = LTV / CAC

Benchmarks and guidance
- Target LTV:CAC >= 3x (for healthy growth economics).
