- Gross margin (or COGS): hosting, third‑party service costs, support/implementation that scale with revenue or customers.
- Churn metrics: monthly logo churn and revenue churn by month (or cohort retention tables).
- Any one‑time onboarding costs per customer (if you want CAC to include onboarding).
- If you use multi‑quarter sales cycles, indicate time to first revenue and whether you treat first invoice as acquisition or when contract signed.

