- LTV = 53.60 * 20 ≈ $1,072
- LTV:CAC ≈ 1,072 / 750 ≈ 1.43x
- Payback = 750 / 53.60 ≈ 14.0 months

Interpretation: Weak unit economics. LTV:CAC is well below target; either reduce CAC, increase price/ARPU, improve retention, or increase gross margin.

