- Lifetime_months = 1 / churn_monthly  (if churn is monthly)
- LTV = ARPA_month * GrossMargin * Lifetime_months
- CAC payback (months) = CAC / (ARPA_month * GrossMargin)
- LTV : CAC ratio = LTV / CAC  (target >= 3x is a common rule of thumb)

